    "All data on this %1$@ will be replaced with this backup (%2$@). Your current data is saved first as a Before restore backup, so you can go back. App Lock, Hide amounts, report exclusions and theme on this %1$@ don’t change.": {
      "comment": "Warning before a restore. %1$@ is the device; %2$@ is the backup's summary, such as “Today, 9:12 AM · 3 accounts · 120 transactions”.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All data on this %1$@ will be replaced with this backup (%2$@). Your current data is saved first as a Before restore backup, so you can go back. App Lock, Hide amounts, report exclusions and theme on this %1$@ don’t change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any backup can be deleted. Delete asks you to confirm, and asks for Face ID or the app passcode first when App Lock is on.": {
      "comment": "Backup detail footnote on a device with Face ID; the Keep footer follows.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any backup can be deleted. Delete asks you to confirm, and asks for Face ID or the app passcode first when App Lock is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any backup can be deleted. Delete asks you to confirm, and asks for Optic ID or the app passcode first when App Lock is on.": {
