            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any backup can be deleted. Delete asks you to confirm, and asks for Optic ID or the app passcode first when App Lock is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any backup can be deleted. Delete asks you to confirm, and asks for Touch ID or the app passcode first when App Lock is on.": {
